  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A book of mass m lies on top of a table of mass M that rolls freely along the ground. The coefficient of friction between the book and the table is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mu\"></span>. A person is pushing the rolling table.</p>\n<p>What is the maximum acceleration of the table so that the book does not slide backwards relative to the table?</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{g}{\\mu }\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\mu g\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mg}{M \\mu}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{m}{M}\\mu g\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
